BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bbb57fec-9fc5-3501-9b49-3d541d6c83dc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
